                    "note": "Untyped on purpose: the blow's own damage types are not carried across the event, and guessing one would hand the Quincy a resistance or a weakness the harm never had. The reduction is `Effect: The Balance — Redistributed`, which reads three times the level at the Vollständig, so the arithmetic the clause asks for happens through the same resistance the Release Technique uses rather than through a second number."
